<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">
<span id="id1" class="ltx_inline-block fa fa-scissors" aria-hidden="true">
</span>   Cutting the Skip: Training Residual-Free Transformers

<br class="ltx_break"></h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Yiping JiJames Martens
</span><span id="id2" class="ltx_note ltx_note_frontmatter ltx_thanks_correspondence ltx_role_thanks"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">†</sup><span class="ltx_note_outer"><span class="ltx_note_content"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">†</sup><span class="ltx_note_type">thanks: </span>Corresponding e-mail:yiping.ji@adelaide.edu.au</span></span></span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
