<figure id="S6.F3" class="ltx_figure">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 3: </span>Pretrained DINO ViT-Small models for 300 epochs. For skipless models, we also evaluated checkpoint at 200 epochs. Performance on object discovery tasks using TokenCut on VOC2012 and COCO20k datasets.</figcaption>
<table id="S6.F3.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="S6.F3.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S6.F3.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_r ltx_border_tt" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;"></th>
<td id="S6.F3.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;" colspan="3">VOC2012</td>
<td id="S6.F3.2.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_l ltx_border_tt" style="padding-top:-0.5pt;padding-bottom:-0.5pt;" colspan="3">COCO20k</td></tr>
<tr id="S6.F3.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
